Context-Aware Prompting
----------------------

Definition

Context-Aware Prompting means using previous conversation and current context when creating the prompt sent to the AI model.

Instead of sending only the latest question, the system also sends relevant previous messages.

Example

Conversation:

User:
Show Chennai news.

AI:
Heavy rain expected in Chennai.

User:
Translate it.

The prompt sent to the AI becomes:

Conversation:

User:
Show Chennai news.

AI:
Heavy rain expected in Chennai.

User:
Translate it into Tamil.

The AI understands that "it" refers to the Chennai news.

Simple Definition

Context-Aware Prompting means sending previous conversation context along with the current question so the AI understands what the user is referring to.
